{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "af9c5f07-f311-8847-b797-6aab189c3bef",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T10:41:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. So, my name is Lidia Rocha, and I rent the upstairs unit here, and my landlord told me when I moved in that trash goes out on a certain day, and I've been putting everything out the night before like you're supposed to. Um, and there's a couch involved too, so that's part of why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a couch. Is that something you want picked up as a bulk item?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. It's an old sofa, the fabric one, it's not worth anything, the cushions are shot. I put it out at the curb with the regular trash and the recycling, and the truck came by and took the bins, but the couch is still sitting there. And that's the second miss in a row, because the week before, the recycling bin was skipped too, I think because I had it next to the couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "398 Dixon Street, in the North End. It's the gray house with the porch, the couch is on the grass by the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 398 Dixon. So here's the thing, bulk items usually have to be scheduled ahead of time, they don't just get picked up with the regular trash. Did you call in for a pickup before you put it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I didn't. I didn't know that was a step. I just assumed since it was trash day it would go. Is there a way to schedule it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can set that up for you. I'll put it in as a bulk pickup for that address. It'll go on the next available bulk day for your route, and I'd leave it where it is, at the curb, not blocking the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. It's on the grass, so it's not blocking anything. And what about the recycling that got skipped? It's still full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just keep that bin out of the way of the couch next time, a few feet apart, and put it out again for your next regular day. If it gets missed again, call me back and I'll send it to the supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll do that. Oh, and sorry, one more unrelated thing, do you happen to know if the city has any list of tailors? I need to find a good one to hem some trousers, and I figured while I had somebody on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no, we don't keep a list like that here. Your best bet is to search online for tailors and alterations in Newport and read the reviews."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that makes sense. Okay, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the pickup, in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162, got it. You're all set, Lidia. The couch is scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you very much. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
